WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
The dragon house is locked

2
00:00:03,990 --> 00:00:05,470
Doors and windows should also be posted

3
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:06,670
Reinforce it

4
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:09,170
The village cadre came to say

5
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:11,010
This typhoon is very fierce

6
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:12,410
More fierce than ever

7
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:14,210
We have to evacuate later

8
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:15,530
Go higher

9
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:18,120
Farming started with loans

10
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,880
I feel bad if one of them dies

11
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:21,820
What if it floods?

12
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,660
The wind blew the door open

13
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:29,380
The roof comes first, that’s fine

14
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:30,980
Isn't one enough?

15
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:43,140
It would be better if there was no typhoon
